# Amazon product pool (your curated links) — committed so the cloud pipeline has it.
# products.txt is tracked; keep real credentials out of it (just Name | /dp/ASIN links).

# Cloud state that MUST persist across runs (committed):
#   pending.json  — approval queue   | state/ — product rotation | history/ — dedup
!pending.json
!state/
!history/

